  "<b>Variance.</b> E[e_q²] = (1/Δ) ∫ e² de from −Δ/2 to Δ/2 = (1/Δ)[e³/3] = (1/Δ)(Δ³/24 + Δ³/24) = Δ²/12. Since the mean is zero, the noise power is P_q = Δ²/12.",
  "<b>SQNR.</b> A full-scale sine has A = (x_max − x_min)/2 = LΔ/2 and power A²/2 = L²Δ²/8. SQNR = (L²Δ²/8)/(Δ²/12) = 1.5L² = 1.5 × 4ⁿ, so in dB SQNR = 10 log₁₀ 1.5 + 20n log₁₀ 2 = 1.76 + 6.02n dB.",
